# Cloudflare Pages — routing rules
# Order matters: first match wins.
#
# Pages Functions are matched BEFORE this file, so `/api/*` is handled by
# `functions/api/**` (books, ai, news, analytics, reading) and never reaches
# the SPA fallback below. Anything unknown under /api/ is caught by
# `functions/api/[[route]].ts`, which returns JSON 404 instead of HTML.

# SPA fallback routing — all unmatched client-side routes serve index.html.
/*    /index.html   200
